  {
    "episode_id": 90562,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90562.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "So Bob, if you're a Republican in the Trump campaign, are you going to, it seems to me there's a fork in the road here. You can either paint Kamala Harris as a left-wing black radical, angry black radical, who loves immigrants, who are coming in to take our jobs, you know, color black panther. Or are you afraid of that over the gender stuff? and you go softer and just accuser of being yoked to Biden and a failure at the border.",
