      {
        "text": "If Bob is a Republican in the Trump campaign, he faces a strategic choice.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "One possible strategy involves portraying Kamala Harris as a left-wing black radical.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "This portrayal includes depicting her as an 'angry black radical' who supports immigrants.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
