    "turn_text": "I talked to Howard Dean the other day. He wants Roy Cooper from North Carolina to be the VP. People are talking about Andy Beshear in Kentucky. I'm. I'm and Mark Kelly, obviously the astronaut fighter pilot from Arizona, a swing state. My sleeper is Pete Buttigieg. I just saw him on the Bill Maher show, and I've never seen anybody as articulate able to prosecute the case against JD Vance. and Trump the way Buttigieg does. Now, I don't know if a gay man on the ticket, you know, sinks it, but boy, he is articulate. Do you have a pick right off the top of your head?",
