    "turn_idx": 57,
    "turn_text": "Up here in Bernie World, just this will interest you. there is some leftover agita from the Bernie wing because they are still smarting from the Biden slash Obama people who pushed Bernie, the Clyburn effort to, you know, Buttigieg, Klobuchar, you know, everybody getting out of that race and consolidating behind Biden, you know, Bernie's still kind of kind of resentful of that. And so it's taking, I think, the progressive wing of the Democratic Party a little bit. It'll take them a few days to say, wow, you know, the billionaires didn't Democratic donors wanted Biden out. They got him out. They wanted us out. They got us out. And now they expect us to fall in line. And there's still a little resentment up here.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
