    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "I am imagining that some of the top people won't remain, but some of the others have to remain. I think that'll be part of it. The other thing is, you just said something that hits me hard because I've managed a lot of campaigns, but I've been in for 24 years, my own campaigns. And one thing I learned way early on, define yourself before the opponent defines you. And although she's a sitting VP, if Trump rolls out this definition of her and it sticks, it makes it harder for her. So yes, they are going to have to, in a matter of a two week period here, I think, define who they want Kamala Harris to be before the American public, before it's defined for them.",
